			<string>PSGroupSpecifier</string>
			<key>Title</key>
			<string>幀率 · Frame rate</string>
			<key>FooterText</key>
			<string>鎖 30 幀畫面更穩、裝置更涼。隱藏觸控按鍵時可在此設定，重新啟動遊戲後生效；顯示觸控按鍵時也可在遊戲中切換 · 30 is steadier and keeps the device cooler. With touch controls hidden, choose here and relaunch; visible touch controls also let you switch while playing</string>
		</dict>
